  "goodToKnow": "Die Rakete is a rocket or missile: eine Rakete starten, die Mondrakete. At Silvester (New Year's Eve), Germans fire off huge numbers of Raketen and Böller (bangers); fireworks are normally only sold on the last three days of the year. Rocket pioneer Wernher von Braun developed the V2 for the Nazis before leading NASA's Saturn V programme. From Italian rocchetta, a small spindle."
